<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices - Oct 1.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices - Oct 1.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>International prices for milling and Durum wheat were lower as the weather forecasts for U.S. Midwest and Central Plains and the Canadian Praries improved, the Australian Wheat Board (AWB) said. Wheat indicator prices for multi-grade contracts 96/97 and Durum fell by A$1.00.</p>
<p>Prices, FOB, in A$ per tonne:</p>
<p>		    ASW 10 pct		   No 1 DURUM</p>
